      "new_file": false,
      "renamed_file": false,
      "deleted_file": false,
      "generated_file": false
    },
    {
      "diff": "@@ -125,7 +125,7 @@ Package: wireshark-dev\n Architecture: any\n Section: devel\n Depends: ${misc:Depends}, omniidl (>= 4.0.1-2), libpcap0.8-dev,\n- libglib2.0-dev, python3:any, python3-ply, snacc,\n+ libglib2.0-dev, python3:any, python3-ply, esnacc,\n  libwireshark-dev, libwiretap-dev\n Description: network traffic analyzer - development tools\n  Wireshark is a network \"sniffer\" - a tool that captures and analyzes\n",
      "collapsed": false,
      "too_large": false,
      "new_path": "packaging/debian/control",
      "old_path": "packaging/debian/control",
      "a_mode": "100644",
